TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial solution in cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings shift cell eqfrac_CaX2
    10 PUNCH TOTAL_TIME, CELL_NO, EQUIV_FRACTION(CaX2)

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -lengths 10*1
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 10*0
    -punch_cells 1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
END
